-### CR4 A6: the creator group at the slot's last sector (2026-11-15)
-
-Measured on origin `6e8363ab` (with A1b, S3-2, CR-SLIDERX) + A6, clean build (`cmake --preset ps1 -DDOOMO_INTRO_REQUIRED=ON`):
-**130,000 B (126 KB) below the stack top, `_end` 0x801e0420: the same as the tip without A6** (the tip's own number in the
-CR-SLIDERX section above). The creator group (`.ovl_03`, which borrows `.bss`) grew 183,000 -> 184,496 B with the 55 catalog rows
-and names (`doomo_part_meta` +880 B, `doomo_part_names` +617 B) and its last whole sector passed the slot's end: `ovl_plan.py` lost
-the running end of an earlier borrowing group (found independently here and by CR-SLIDERX; CR-SLIDERX's fix, `ff710398`, is the one
-in the tree). The slot's 2 KB growth is therefore already in the tip's 130,000 B. No resident code or data changed. The creator
-group has no room left in its last sector: the next creator batch costs another 2 KB of slot.
+### CR4 A6: hats and glasses, resident margin (2026-11-15)
+
+Measured on origin `098f0878` (with CR10) and the same + A6, clean builds (`cmake --preset ps1 -DDOOMO_INTRO_REQUIRED=ON`, boot FMV):
+the tip ends **110,608 B** below the stack top, with A6 **110,288 B (107 KB)**: -320 B resident (the 55 catalog rows and names; the part
+scripts and icons themselves are data, not code). Well above the 72 KB rule. Harness on PCSX-Redux: `game_smoke`, `creator_parts`,
+`creator_speed` (29 fps) and `creator_parts_hats` PASS. The earlier note that the creator group sits at the slot's last sector is
+overtaken by CR10 (the PS1 reads part scripts and icons from PARTS.BIN).
